    "name": "Sync WhatsApp conversations to GoHighLevel notes with Wati and Google Sheets",
    "wechat": "youandme10086",
    "id": 18753,
    "update_time": "2026-09-27"
  },
  "name": "Wati to GoHighLevel Conversation Sync",
  "tags": [],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "92a1c92d-adcd-42b6-8083-148d135d8cba",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -2128,
        2336
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 2,
        "width": 616,
        "height": 672,
        "content": "## 🧩 Wati to GoHighLevel Conversation Sync\n\n### How it works\nThis workflow keeps GoHighLevel contact notes in sync with WhatsApp conversations handled through Wati. It listens for two kinds of events: delivery status updates on messages you've sent, and new messages coming in from customers. For each event it looks up (or creates) the matching GoHighLevel contact, then drops the WhatsApp message text onto that contact as a note. A Google Sheet acts as a lightweight index, mapping each Wati conversation to a row so the workflow can tell whether it has already handled that conversation before deciding whether to search for an existing contact or create a fresh one.\n\n### Setup steps\n1. Add your Wati API credentials to every Wati node.\n2. Connect Google Sheets and point both sheet nodes at your own tracking spreadsheet (columns: \"Wati ID\", \"Conversation ID\").\n3. Replace the GoHighLevel placeholder token and location ID in every HTTP Request node's Authorization header and query/body parameters.\n4. Point your Wati webhooks (message delivered + message received) at the two webhook URLs this workflow generates.\n5. Send a test WhatsApp message and confirm a note appears on the right contact in GoHighLevel."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "db2ad640-0c8b-470e-bef5-0af31c3d6be9",
      "name": "Section - Delivery Status Intake",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1104,
        2592
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 632,
        "height": 472,
        "content": "## 📩 Delivery Status Intake\nFires when Wati confirms a message was delivered. Pulls the conversation's message history and checks the tracking sheet for a matching row before moving on to contact lookup."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "0e3941bd-75fa-43a6-b171-8ec5d6111e4e",
      "name": "Section - Match Contact & Log Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -416,
        2560
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1094,
        "height": 488,
        "content": "## 🔍 Match Contact & Log Note\nLooks up the sender in Wati, then searches GoHighLevel for a matching contact and logs the message as a note when one is found."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "998075cf-c390-4f7a-8665-b59744bdbc85",
      "name": "Section - Incoming Message Intake",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1248,
        3200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 940,
        "height": 524,
        "content": "## 📥 Incoming Message Intake\nTriggers on new inbound WhatsApp messages. Fetches the sender's Wati profile and checks the tracking sheet to see if this conversation has been logged before — that decides which path runs next."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "a50cc45c-b24a-4605-9e61-6ceb0be7edee",
      "name": "Section - Known Conversation Path",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -272,
        3136
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 790,
        "height": 408,
        "content": "## 🔁 Known Conversation → Add Note\nFor conversations already in the tracking sheet, this searches GoHighLevel by WhatsApp ID and appends the message as a note on the existing contact."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "6b001520-2dec-4294-ae58-5ead0c9ee66f",
      "name": "Section - New Conversation Path",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -176,
        3616
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1178,
        "height": 700,
        "content": "## 🆕 New Conversation → Create or Match Contact\nFor conversations not yet logged, this records the mapping in the sheet, then searches GoHighLevel for the contact — creating a new one if none exists — before logging the message as a note."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "4ea2a263-b14d-447a-a286-ca9e950120e5",
      "name": "Credentials & Security",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        944,
