        "height": 340,
        "content": "## 🔐 Credentials & Security\nUse Wati API credentials and OAuth2 for Google Sheets. Store the GoHighLevel token as a Private Integration Token — replace the placeholder before running, never commit it as plain text."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
